{"id":"vod_sn_36311","vodId":"36311","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"熊熊勇闯异世界","name_cn":"熊熊勇闯异世界","date":"2020-01-01","year":"2020","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/675e7c7d30869b8c5d2589b302d60930.jpg"},"summary":"优奈（河濑茉希 配音）表面看上去是平平无奇的家里蹲网瘾少女，可实际上却是大型虚拟现实多人在线角色扮演游戏《幻想世界Online》中的骨灰级玩家。一天，优奈和往常一样登录游戏，却发现自己竟然莫名其妙的穿戴上了“熊熊套装”，虽然这熊里熊气的套装看上去非常的愚蠢，但这套装备却拥有着超强的属性，如果脱下这套装备，优奈在这个凶险的异世界里根本无法生存。　　就这样，变身为熊熊少女的优奈展开了新的旅程，善良又身世可怜的女孩菲娜（和气杏未 配音）、拥有可爱外表却格外的坏心眼的诺雅儿（日高里菜 配音）、成熟稳重，品行高贵的大小姐米莎娜（天野聪美 配音），在此过程中，优奈结识了很多有趣的伙伴。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:42:07","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/2Liri3M8Sq1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/kfkfk27pTj1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/UXQs9UniUA1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/v72MQxqpk61/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/KKbiYgsGBS1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/iSucL1B4NX1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/nrbVfYEgBT1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ib4PxaWUKQ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/d4D6hm8YVU1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/e1vwTSKRb51/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/YibRCJetAZ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/VMYPwE598k1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:24.186Z"}